+template through both emitters in semantics.mjs; go/abap parsei8_test.go and
+parsei8.test.mjs check the runtime itself, including the class of the failure
+(a run of zeros longer than int8 has digits, a magnitude that fits a uint64
+and not an int64). Unmeasured on A4H: the rule is the one measured for i
+(ZCL_GOGEN_T_C2NUM) with the range widened, which is what the endpoints ask
+for.
